===== verify-rls-app-paths.mjs (application paths under enforcement) =====
Verifying application paths under RLS in throwaway database crm_rls_apppaths_b82065ca
Admin host: localhost:5432

Application paths, as a NOSUPERUSER role with DB_RLS_ENFORCED=true:

  PASS  verifyAndFetchSharedReport resolves a valid token under enforcement
        returned "Weekly report" for "Acme"
  PASS  the view-counter write lands under enforcement
        viewCount = 1 after one view (expected 1)
  PASS  the same lookup with no bypass returns nothing — the fix is what makes probe 1 pass
        null, as the policy requires
  PASS  a model operation through the extension sees its tenant
        Lead count = 1 (expected 1)
  PASS  bare raw SQL sees nothing — the extension cannot reach root operations
        Lead count via bare $queryRaw = 0, as the policy requires
  PASS  withTenantRaw gives raw SQL its tenant context
        Lead count via withTenantRaw = 1 (expected 1)
  PASS  withBypassRaw reaches rows for deliberately cross-tenant maintenance
        Lead count via withBypassRaw = 1 (expected 1)
  PASS  the AI budget path reserves and settles under enforcement
        reserved 1 then settled to used 1 / reserved 0 (expected 1, 1, 0)
  PASS  createAdminClient reaches rows a bare client cannot
        Lead count = 1 (expected 1; 0 means the options parameter did not take)
  PASS  the same client without the option sees nothing
        Lead count = 0, as the policy requires

Cleaned up crm_rls_apppaths_b82065ca and crm_rls_appuser_ea9650.

All application paths survive DB-level RLS.

